[en.CHARACTER_MAUD_PIE_NAME]
Maud Pie

[en.CHARACTER_MAUD_PIE_DESC]
Maud Pie, full name Maudalina Daisy Pie, was the second eldest of the Pie sisters. Deeply loving her siblings, she never openly showed it. Unlike the timid Marble Pie and the fiery Limestone Pie, Maud Pie, through her interactions with her sister Pinkie Pie and her boyfriend Mudbriar, learned how to navigate social situations with other ponies. Since the end of the Last Roundup, she had been jointly responsible with Limestone Pie for running the rock farm and overseeing the entire domain of autonomy. However, her social skills, while relatively adept within the Pie family, still rendered the family enigmatic and inscrutable to outsiders. Maud Pie earned a bachelor’s degree in geology in 998, and she had a pet named Boulder.
Given her deep connections with the former royal family and f the Elements of Harmony before the Last Roundup, Maud Pie had gained some reputation in Western Equestria. In 1001, after ousting the temporary government set up by the Committee, Maud Pie led the Pie family in controlling vast swathes of land in Western Equestria. Realizing their inability to resist the entire empire, they accepted nominal imperial authority and existed as an autonomous territory. Although Maud Pie had not shown any signs of independence and tried to comply with imperial demands, both Empress Cozy Glow and the Committee harbored resentment towards her and sought alternative solutions. This was not only due to her past, but also her close relationship with Starlight Glimmer the leader of the Liberation Front and AppleLoosa .

[zh.CHARACTER_MAUD_PIE_NAME]
石灰派

[zh.CHARACTER_MAUD_PIE_DESC]
石灰派，全名为石灰丽娜·黛西·派。作为派家族四姐妹的二姐，石灰派深爱着她的姐妹们，但她从来不表现出来。相比较胆小的玉琪派和性格火烈的石青派，石灰派在他的妹妹萍琪派和男朋友泥枝长时间的相处下更懂得如何与其他的小马正确的来往，并从终末之战后和石青派一同承担着运营石头农场和整个自治领的重任。当然，她的社交能力只是相对而言在派家族比较出色，在外界看来，整个派家族仍然是难以接触和琢磨的代表。石灰派于998年拥有岩石学的博石学位，并拥有一个宠物，命名为顽石。
鉴于终末之战前她跟小马利亚前皇室和和谐之元之间深厚的关系，石灰派在西小马利亚享有一定的声誉。在1001年赶走了委员会建立的临时政府后，石灰派带领派家族掌控了西小马利亚的大片土地。自知暂时无力抵抗整个帝国后，石灰派接受了帝国名义上的管辖并且作为自治领存在，虽然目前没有表现出任何独立的倾向并尽量满足着帝国的要求，但女皇可西光辉和委员会仍然时刻对她心存芥蒂，并寻求替代方案，不仅是因为她的过往，还有她与解放阵线的领导马星光熠熠、苹果鲁萨自治领之间的紧密关系。
